* Two tracks in ONE 50k dual-gang frequency potentiometer.
* Matched nominal tracking is assumed. Actual tracking requires specification/calibration.
.subckt FREQ_A T W B
RT T W {max(1m,50k*(1-FP))}
RB W B {max(1m,50k*FP)}
.ends
.subckt FREQ_B T W B
RT T W {max(1m,50k*(1-FP))}
RB W B {max(1m,50k*FP)}
.ends
.subckt DUTY T W B
RT T W {max(1m,1k*(1-DP))}
RB W B {max(1m,1k*DP)}
.ends
.subckt DEAD T W B
RT T W {max(1m,1k*(1-DTP))}
RB W B {max(1m,1k*DTP)}
.ends
.subckt SELECT E P C
RE E C {if(SOURCE,1,1T)}
RP P C {if(SOURCE,1T,1)}
.ends
* Original TI TLC07X_5V family core, applied to TLC072 dual package.
* Voltage behavior retained. Supply accounting is an engineering assumption.
.subckt TLC072CP IP IM VP VN OUT
EISO VISO VN VP VN 1
BIDD VP VN I=3.5m+max(0,I(VOUT))
XREAL IP IM VISO VN CORE TLC07X_5V
VOUT CORE OUT 0
.ends
* Original, unmodified ST LMx19 voltage core; TI LM319N through-hole package candidate.
.subckt LM319_SECTION IP IM VP VN OUT
XREAL IP IM VP VN OUT LMx19
.ends

* One dual-gang 1k dead-time potentiometer with opposed voltage sweeps.
.subckt DT_HIGH T W B
RT T W {max(1m,1k*(1-DTP))}
RB W B {max(1m,1k*DTP)}
.ends
.subckt DT_LOW T W B
RT T W {max(1m,1k*DTP)}
RB W B {max(1m,1k*(1-DTP))}
.ends
.subckt ACT240_INV Y A VP VN
X1 A Y VN VP VN ACT240_CHANNEL TD=4n
.ends
.subckt ACT240_3INV Y A VP VN
X1 A Y VN VP VN ACT240_CHANNEL TD=4n
X2 A Y VN VP VN ACT240_CHANNEL TD=4.1n
X3 A Y VN VP VN ACT240_CHANNEL TD=4.2n
.ends
